        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>It seems like this variant would make the boss less difficult. &nbsp;Is that the case? &nbsp;Does the +fun compensate for the -difficulty?</p><p>I am a big fan of this kind of thing. &nbsp;I made a bunch of alts of villains when I first started playing, but when I actually tried them out, it turned out that my cool ideas were more problematic than I&#39;d anticipated, and my gaming group didn&#39;t have much patience for playtesting my half-baked villains. So that was the end of that. :)</p>",
